@prefix cpannotationschema: <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/schemas/cpannotationschema.owl#> .
@base <http://ecareathome-ontology.mpi.aass.oru.se/patterns/SmartHome_Sensing.owl> .

<http://ecareathome-ontology.mpi.aass.oru.se/patterns/SmartHome_Sensing.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                              owl:imports <http://ecareathome-ontology.mpi.aass.oru.se/patterns/SmartHome_FeatureOfInterest.owl> ,
                                                                                          <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/schemas/cpannotationschema.owl> ;
                                                                              terms:description "Diagram (this article has no graphical representation)"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                              terms:title "Smarthome Sensing Pattern"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                              cpannotationschema:coversRequirements "What is the output of the sensing process?"^^xsd:string ,
                                                                                                                    "What sensors are involved (implement) the sensing process?"^^xsd:string ,
                                                                                                                    "When the sensor output is generated by the sensor?"^^xsd:string ,
                                                                                                                    "Which feature of interest is considered for the observation (sensing) process?"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                              cpannotationschema:isSpecializationOf """The pattern extends both the SSN ontology and DUL. The extension is in the form of specialization of the following classes: http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/ssn#Output
http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#InformationRealization
http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/ssn#Sensing
http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/ssn#SensingDevice"""^^xsd:string ;
                                                                              rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x36; term declared x6;
- header: dcterms:title \"Smarthome Sensing Pattern\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en ;
                                                                              rdfs:isDefinedBy "This pattern uses the ODP featureOfInterest (http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/wiki/Submissions:SmartHome_FeatureOfInterest)."^^xsd:string .

